  - However, **setting verbosity to `"none"` may hide critical security events**, violating **audit trail requirements** in **3GPP TS 33.501, Clause 13.2**.

- **Standard Reference**:
  - **O-RAN WG11 Security-Log-Management-TR.O-R004-v05.00, Clause 5.5.4.3**:
    > *"Log-data injection detection and proper configuration of log-data management system shall be enforced to prevent information leakage."*
  - **Filename**: `O-RAN.WG11.Security-Log-Management-TR.O-R004-v05.00.pdf`

- **Security Risk**:
  - **No visibility** into security events, leading to **undetected attacks** and **compliance violations**.

- **Fix Applied**:
